<title>UK: Tepco prices $500 mln 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Tepco prices $500 mln 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by joint lead managers Goldman Sachs International and Sakura has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOKYO ELECTRIC POWER CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    13.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.815    PAY DATE    13.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    99.815    SPREAD	+26 BP</p>
